        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Set in the extinct world of artisan mining in North Chile, this neo western centers the struggles and empowerment of a young woman, fighting to keep the family business against patriarchal structures and the law of the jungle.",
          "runtime": 83,
